Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.62,0:00:07.69,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,The autumn leaves are beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:11.11,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,We're well into fall, aren't we, Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:13.70,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,We sure are, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.60,0:00:23.88,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I just remembered, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.35,0:00:25.25,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Take this.
