Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:31.51,sign_636_12_Kokutei_High_Sch,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,50)}Kokutei High School School Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.86,0:00:31.51,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,"Kokutei Festival"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.74,0:00:33.42,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Your school festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:37.03,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, are you free for it next weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.03,0:00:39.89,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,My class is doing a maid café.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.46,0:00:47.37,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san... dressed as a maid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:51.71,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I would give my life to attend!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.71,0:00:52.90,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.47,0:00:57.08,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,But make sure you come on Sunday, \Nthe festival's last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.89,0:01:03.15,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,There's a legend at Kokutei High School.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.05,0:01:07.58,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,For the finale of the final \Nday of the Kokutei Festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.58,0:01:10.59,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,the staff makes a crescent-shaped \Nsculpture available for one hour only.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.59,0:01:13.00,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,It's called the "Kokutei Moon."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.21,0:01:18.33,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,The Kokutei Moon is a popular spot for \Ncouples to take pictures together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.49,0:01:21.46,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,And it's said that those who do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.46,0:01:23.93,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,become invincible couples, \Nbound in love for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:27.10,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Well? Isn't that interesting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.10,0:01:29.06,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,What a clever idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.06,0:01:32.68,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I already consider us an invincible couple,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.68,0:01:35.69,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,but I wouldn't object to having \Na little supernatural backing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.98,0:01:40.54,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,But a school festival will \Nsurely be extremely crowded...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.03,0:01:43.95,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yes, we must be certain we aren't seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.95,0:01:47.08,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,This will no doubt be our \Ntoughest mission yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:48.73,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Bring it on, I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.69,0:01:53.31,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Let's do it, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.31,0:01:54.96,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yes, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.24,0:01:57.84,main,Both,0,0,0,,Let's become an invincible couple!
