Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:37.98,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(836,1)\pos(40,60)\fsp.1}Episode 10     {\fscx95}Atop the Kokutei Moon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.99,0:03:45.99,sign_5323_47_Cotton_Candy,sign,0,0,0,,Cotton Candy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.54,0:03:55.00,main,Girl A,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:56.72,main,Girl B,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.72,0:03:57.84,main,Girl C,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:03:58.88,main,Girl D,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.91,0:04:02.18,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:08.26,main,Girls,0,0,0,,It's Hayato-kun, the hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:10.19,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,That's right, I'm finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.19,0:04:12.59,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,The cerulean gem of Gelato 5,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.59,0:04:15.78,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Hayato Ojino is in the building!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.65,0:04:19.70,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,And the crimson brick, Fudo, is here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:20.88,main,Girl C,0,0,0,,Fudo-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.88,0:04:22.32,main,Boy A,0,0,0,,Hot stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.35,0:04:25.09,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this, Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.09,0:04:27.07,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Silence, traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.53,0:04:29.56,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,This is your punishment for trying to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.56,0:04:33.00,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,attend this blissful event \Nwithout inviting me along!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.73,0:04:36.17,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Can you at least try to be subtle about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:37.75,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.11,0:04:39.61,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:41.79,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,I want all girls, front and center!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:45.65,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Don't be shy, or you'll regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.65,0:04:49.10,italicstop,Changer,0,0,0,,Two! Change Gelat—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:52.73,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Now, which version is your preferred flavor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.69,0:04:52.73,italicstop,Changer,0,0,0,,Two! Change—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:53.73,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.05,0:04:54.29,italicstop,Changer,0,0,0,,Two! Change—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:55.06,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.06,0:04:56.31,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.06,0:04:59.42,italicstop,Changer,0,0,0,,Two! Change Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.43,0:04:58.27,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.58,0:05:00.94,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Hey! Where are you going, Fudo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:01.62,main,Girl C,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:02.86,main,Boy A,0,0,0,,Where's Fudo-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:05.45,main,Both,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.45,0:05:09.95,main,Boy A,0,0,0,,Fudo-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:10.99,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:15.43,sign_7473_84_I_ll_come_to_see,Sign,0,0,0,,I'll come to see you at your shop\N\N\h\h\h\h\h\hWe're in classroom 2-B
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.93,0:05:17.54,sign_7473_84_I_ll_come_to_see,sign,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Desumi-san
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.43,0:05:17.54,sign_7473_84_I_ll_come_to_see,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(30,105)}Things have gotten a little complicated
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:20.30,main,Friend A/B,0,0,0,,Have a good day, master!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:21.55,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,A little complicated?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:22.99,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,Hey, Desumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.99,0:05:24.61,main,Friend A,0,0,0,,What's up? You seem distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.61,0:05:26.24,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,N-No, I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:28.18,main,Friend B,0,0,0,,Help us make parfaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:29.98,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,S-Sure, on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:33.82,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,H-Hojo-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.82,0:05:36.19,main,Anna,0,0,0,,"Things have gotten a little complicated"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.19,0:05:38.44,main,Anna,0,0,0,,What's all this now, Desucchi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:40.22,main,Anna,0,0,0,,Meeting up with your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:42.34,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,O-Of course not...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:43.19,main,Anna,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.19,0:05:45.13,main,Anna,0,0,0,,No real plans, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:46.20,main,Anna,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.78,0:05:50.95,main,Anna,0,0,0,,Wanna go to the Kokutei Moon with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.89,0:05:55.32,main,Anna,0,0,0,,C'mon. We'd be an invincible couple!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.78,0:05:57.61,main,Anna,0,0,0,,Well? Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.16,0:05:58.71,top,Desumi,0,0,0,,Wait, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.61,0:05:58.13,main,Anna,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.33,0:06:01.56,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.57,0:06:02.93,top,Anna,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Desucchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:08.27,main,Girlfriend,0,0,0,,Hey, wanna go to the Kokutei Moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.27,0:06:10.30,main,Boyfriend,0,0,0,,Why would we need to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:13.66,main,Boyfriend,0,0,0,,We're already deeply in love, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:15.46,main,Girlfriend,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.46,0:06:18.51,main,Girlfriend,0,0,0,,No one can ever tear us a—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.78,0:06:19.02,top,Kiki,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:21.56,sign_9132_124_Lifetime_Soldier,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\pos(165,20)}Discipline Officer
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:30.95,sign_9132_124_Lifetime_Soldier,sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\pos(425,20)}Discipline Officer
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:30.95,sign_10543_121_Menacing,sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H156D8D&\3c&H730080&}Threatening
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.83,0:06:23.58,main,Boyfriend,0,0,0,,Who the heck are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:25.93,main,Girlfriend,0,0,0,,The discipline officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.93,0:06:30.95,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,The purpose of school festivals is \Nto promote a spirit of community!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:33.63,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Not to get all lovey-dovey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.63,0:06:34.87,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.87,0:06:36.20,main,Both,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:40.83,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,Goodness me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.21,0:06:44.57,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,Are you jealous because \Nyou're all alone, Kiki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.09,0:06:46.61,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,What was that, Kyoko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.61,0:06:48.81,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,I'm not jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.81,0:06:51.10,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Lapses in discipline lead \Nto lapses in morality!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:53.24,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,I won't leave a single couple standing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.24,0:06:54.30,main,Shoko,0,0,0,,Scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.54,0:06:57.33,main,Shoko,0,0,0,,Then I'd better get away before \Nyou try to take us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.33,0:06:58.12,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.11,0:07:00.76,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,Right, Bear-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:01.33,sign_10073_134_Plush,sign,0,0,0,,{\move(505,225,500,195)\fad(216,243)}Plush
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:02.81,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Are you crazy or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.81,0:07:08.40,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,And why the hell isn't the sight of a \Nbear in school causing a mass panic?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.63,0:07:10.37,main,Costumer A,0,0,0,,Look at that bear costume!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.37,0:07:12.02,main,Costumer B,0,0,0,,Awesome quality!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.02,0:07:15.05,main,Costumer C,0,0,0,,Nice! Must be pretty hot in that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.90,0:07:18.81,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,Now I bid you good day, Kiki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:20.61,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,Keep the violence to a minimum, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:29.17,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Death to all couples!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.17,0:07:33.68,sign_10770_143_Haunted_House,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscy150}Haunted House
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:45.19,sign_7473_84_I_ll_come_to_see,sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\move(395,100,390,95)\frz-11.96\fax-0.2\fs9\t(1,4000,\fs8.5)}I'm sorry, Desumi-san
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:45.19,sign_7473_84_I_ll_come_to_see,sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\move(365,190,360,180)\fax-0.2\fs9\t(1,4000,\fs8.5)\frz344.9}Things have gotten a little complicated
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:45.19,sign_7473_84_I_ll_come_to_see,sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\move(365,280,360,265)\fax-0.2\fs9\t(1,4000,\fs8.5)\frz343.7}Let's meet up\N in the haunted house
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:45.19,sign_7473_84_I_ll_come_to_see,sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\move(335,370,330,350)\fax-0.2\fs9\t(1,4000,\fs8.5)\frz343.7}Classroom 3-A
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:48.17,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I think I finally lost her...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.74,0:07:53.09,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:54.51,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.51,0:07:58.30,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Your unprecedented cuteness revolutionizes \Nthe concept of the maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.30,0:08:02.37,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,The word "cute" hardly \Nseems sufficient anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:02.37,sign_11474_152_Thoughtful,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(305,105,310,85)\bord2\fad(335,1)}Thoughtful
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.37,0:08:04.03,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,This is no time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.03,0:08:05.63,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Let's hide back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.75,0:08:10.40,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.40,0:08:12.22,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,This has all been such a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:17.18,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,No, a glance at you in your maid \Noutfit makes anything worthwhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.18,0:08:19.63,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,R-Really? I'm glad...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.63,0:08:21.83,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,But you're embarrassing me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.01,0:08:24.47,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:27.30,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Look, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:31.29,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,These are the sweets we serve \Nin our class's maid café.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.69,0:08:42.60,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,W-Welcome home, master!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:50.56,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I might be the luckiest master \Nin all of human history!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.56,0:08:52.42,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Oh, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.69,0:08:55.79,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,They're delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.30,0:08:57.48,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:04.33,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,But... it really might be impossible \Nfor us to be alone together
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:06.59,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,at the school festival, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.59,0:09:10.63,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,No, I believe we can overcome any \Ntrial the world throws at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.27,0:09:17.44,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,We must arrive at it no matter what...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:19.78,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Our shared Kokutei Moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.73,0:09:26.93,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.67,0:09:29.89,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.89,0:09:31.30,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I should have confidence in us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:33.70,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I feel bad for leaving my class in the lurch,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.70,0:09:35.78,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,but let's wait here until the finale—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:37.61,top,Kiki,0,0,0,,Illicit heterosexual relations detected!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.73,0:09:42.58,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,I'm going to crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:44.60,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Tell me your year and class number!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:44.59,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:45.60,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:46.60,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.05,0:09:48.67,italics,Both,0,0,0,,Let's meet up again later!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.54,0:10:09.56,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I think I lost her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:18.55,main,Anna,0,0,0,,Don't be so cold, Desucchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.90,0:10:23.16,main,Anna,0,0,0,,You promised you'd go to \Nthe Kokutei Moon with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:25.07,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I don't think I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.81,0:10:35.07,sign_15125_190_UMA_Study_Group_,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(150,20)\bord3\3c&HD7D7D1&}UMA {\c&H569EC2&}Study Group\N{\c&H7034EC&}Famous {\c&H4B4A83&}UMA{\c&HE38048&}-yaki
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:36.73,main,Mob Boy,0,0,0,,This is gonna be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:38.74,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,The couples have begun their exodus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.35,0:10:41.62,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,We have very little time left!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:46.53,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Where have you been, Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.53,0:10:50.00,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,You promised you'd serve \Nas my horse all day long!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:51.93,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I never made any such promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.10,0:10:54.09,main,Girl B,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.09,0:10:55.52,main,Girl,0,0,0,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.52,0:10:57.27,main,Boy A,0,0,0,,Fudo-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.27,0:10:58.56,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:01.90,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.53,0:11:07.59,italics,Announcement,0,0,0,,Attention, Kokutei Festival goers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.59,0:11:09.47,italics,Announcement,0,0,0,,The time has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:14.15,italics,Announcement,0,0,0,,It's the shining jewel of the \NKokutei festival finale...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:16.95,italics,Announcement,0,0,0,,the Kokutei Moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.95,0:11:19.82,italics,Announcement,0,0,0,,It will be available for one hour only!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:25.87,italics,Announcement,0,0,0,,All couples, please gather \Naround the front entrance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.72,0:11:33.95,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Love After World Domination!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.65,0:11:54.79,main,Anna,0,0,0,,Desucchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:08.12,main,Anna,0,0,0,,You can't get away from me, Desucchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:11.37,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,H-Hojo-san! You're really \Nathletic, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.67,0:12:24.18,sign_17807_212_Missing,Sign,0,0,0,,Nurse's Office
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.18,0:12:31.03,main,Anna,0,0,0,,Just give in already, Desucchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.03,0:12:33.44,main,Kira,0,0,0,,My, my. Magahara-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:35.94,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I need your h-help, Blood Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:40.19,main,Kira,0,0,0,,None of that, now, Reaper-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:43.82,main,Kira,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to \Ncall me that at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.97,0:12:47.45,sign_18317_218_Gekko_Princess_S,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(140,125)\fad(1002,1)}Gekko Princess Series\N{\fs19}Blood Princess\N{\fs21}Kira Sanzugawa
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:49.91,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,S-Sorry about that, Sanzugawa-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.91,0:12:51.70,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,But I have some urgent business to attend to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.97,0:12:54.64,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Could you hold off the girl on the \Nother side of this door for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.64,0:12:57.59,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I can't seem to get her to leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.59,0:13:00.29,main,Kira,0,0,0,,That's no good, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:04.59,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Bosslar-chan would be furious if he \Ncaught me using my powers at school!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.59,0:13:06.55,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Please! I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.83,0:13:08.80,main,Kira,0,0,0,,I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.60,0:13:13.95,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I-I'll give you a Super Bosslar-kun Doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.87,0:13:22.32,sign_24298_247_squee,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(240,20)\fad(90,1)}squee♥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:17.51,italics,narrator,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.51,0:13:21.87,italics,narrator,0,0,0,,Blood Princess is in love \Nwith Supreme Ruler Bosslar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:25.05,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Well, perhaps just this once!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:25.82,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.18,0:13:35.04,main,Kira,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere, Hojo-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:37.96,italics,Anna,0,0,0,,Ugh, Blood Princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:39.54,italics,Anna,0,0,0,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:43.55,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Why don't you stick around and \Nhave a nice, long talk with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:47.38,main,Anna,0,0,0,,Stop me, if you think you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.05,0:13:50.80,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Bad girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.35,0:13:57.85,sign_20053_239_Nurse_s_Office_A,sign,0,0,0,,Nurse's Office Announcements
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:03.86,main,Kira,0,0,0,,Gracious. You're awfully strong, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:07.82,italics,Anna,0,0,0,,That's 'cause I'm also part \Nof the Princess Series!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.01,0:14:10.30,main,crowd,0,0,0,,An explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.30,0:14:11.78,main,crowd,0,0,0,,Some kind of event?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:15.84,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,That bought me a little time, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:17.42,main,Girl,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.33,0:14:20.04,main,Girl Student B,0,0,0,,Isn't that Red and Blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:21.79,main,Girl Student A,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.79,0:14:22.79,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Red?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:23.87,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.06,0:14:23.42,sign_20693_251_spank_spank,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(345,200)\fad(1,360)}spank\Nspank
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.46,0:14:23.92,sign_20693_251_spank_spank,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(345,200)\fad(111,360)}spank\Nspank
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.87,0:14:25.54,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Run, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.96,0:14:24.42,sign_20693_251_spank_spank,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(345,200)\fad(111,360)}spank\Nspank
