Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:27.99,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,What in the world is happening there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.46,0:14:26.92,sign_20693_251_spank_spank,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(345,200)\fad(111,360)}spank\Nspank
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.97,0:14:27.42,sign_20693_251_spank_spank,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(345,200)\fad(111,360)}spank\Nspank
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.47,0:14:27.92,sign_20693_251_spank_spank,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(345,200)\fad(111,360)}spank\Nspank
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:28.43,sign_20693_251_spank_spank,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(345,200)\fad(111,360)}spank\Nspank
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.47,0:14:28.55,sign_20693_251_spank_spank,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(345,200)\fad(40,1)}spank\Nspank
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.06,0:14:30.22,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:31.73,top,Boy A,0,0,0,,Hot stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:32.31,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.00,0:14:34.51,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Hey, Desumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.01,0:14:35.78,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Kiki?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.78,0:14:37.07,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,You got nothing better to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.07,0:14:39.73,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Come help me track down couples.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.73,0:14:42.83,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,She didn't realize that was \Nme in the haunted house?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.83,0:14:44.26,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.73,0:14:47.87,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,A-Actually, I do have a few plans...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.87,0:14:49.40,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,But we've reached the finale.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:51.23,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,What plans could you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.75,0:14:53.12,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Wait a minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:57.61,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,You {\i1}did{\i0} mention you were interested \Nin romance that one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.37,0:15:00.97,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've got a boyfriend, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.97,0:15:02.60,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Wait! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.59,0:15:04.58,italics,Kiki,0,0,0,,Shiver...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.59,0:15:05.34,sign_21665_281_Shiver,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(70,175)\frz51.28}S\NH\NI\NV\NE\NR
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.31,0:15:08.19,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,Th-This chilling aura...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.78,0:15:16.85,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,We meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.85,0:15:19.35,main,Kiki,0,0,0,,H-He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.85,0:15:20.06,italicstop,Hayato,0,0,0,,We meet again. {\fs20}We meet again. {\fs16}We meet again.\N{\fs12} We meet again. {\fs8}We meet again...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.63,0:15:24.56,main,Hayato,0,0,0,,Haven't seen you since the beach!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.05,0:15:27.16,main,Girls,0,0,0,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:32.41,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.16,0:15:34.37,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Now's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.37,0:15:35.83,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:53.22,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,We're running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:54.50,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:57.72,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,But they all recognize you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:16:00.26,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,And Princess Series members \Nare all around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.23,0:16:05.36,sign_23047_297_Kokutei_Festival,Sign,0,0,0,,Kokutei Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.53,0:16:05.36,main,Staff,0,0,0,,Just five minutes left with the Kokutei Moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.91,0:16:18.71,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,To break through the crowd and sit \Nthere without anyone seeing us...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.16,0:16:23.55,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I'm out of ideas!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.05,0:16:26.68,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,Who in the world are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.07,0:16:30.11,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,I thought you were Bear-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.11,0:16:32.92,main,Bear Costumer,0,0,0,,Hang on! You're the one who grabbed on to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:35.71,main,Shoko,0,0,0,,What are you trying to pull with \Nthis extremely detailed costume?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.71,0:16:37.98,main,Bear Costumer,0,0,0,,I just really like bears, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.98,0:16:40.57,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,Then where is the real Bear-sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.57,0:16:42.20,main,Bear Costumer,0,0,0,,How should I know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.20,0:16:43.25,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,Oh, for pity's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:45.14,main,Kyoko,0,0,0,,Cosplay makes everything so confusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.65,0:16:49.02,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo! We still have a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:50.86,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,We can't give up yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.86,0:16:52.19,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.67,0:17:02.45,main,staff,0,0,0,,We'll take one more couple \Nbefore closing up shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.57,0:17:02.45,sign_23047_297_Kokutei_Festival,Sign,0,0,0,,Kokutei Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.45,0:17:04.96,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure we can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:07.00,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yes, I know that we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:08.71,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.18,0:17:10.09,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.40,0:17:12.27,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:14.94,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You're right,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:17.08,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.38,0:17:23.68,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Freezing Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.17,0:17:28.15,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Welcome Evil! Punish Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.32,0:17:34.67,italics,Changer,0,0,0,,One! Change Gelato!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.47,0:17:38.16,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Reaper Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.38,0:18:03.52,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Let's go, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.90,0:18:05.50,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yes, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.27,0:18:07.89,main,Student Man I,0,0,0,,Just one couple left?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.49,0:18:10.23,main,Student Man A,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:13.66,main,Student Girl U,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.66,0:18:15.33,main,Student Man Costumer E,0,0,0,,Awesome taste!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:18.40,main,Student Man Ka,0,0,0,,Amazing quality, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.65,0:18:20.72,main,Student Man Costumer Ki,0,0,0,,It's pretty fanfic, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.72,0:18:21.66,main,Student Man Costumer Ku,0,0,0,,Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.66,0:18:25.32,main,Student Man Costumer Ku,0,0,0,,Red Gelato and Reaper Princess, getting along?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:57.13,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,When you and I work together,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.13,0:18:59.70,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,there is nothing that we cannot achieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.70,0:19:03.70,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yes, because we are an invincible couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.17,0:19:08.16,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Perhaps the day when we can see \Neach other with heads held high
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:11.60,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,isn't so far away after all, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.60,0:19:13.71,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Yes indeed, Desumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.15,0:19:20.14,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,And until that day comes, I'm going \Nto enjoy having this little secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.46,0:19:22.25,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:35.19,main,Staff,0,0,0,,Okay! I'm taking the picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.23,0:21:20.67,main,Drone,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.91,0:21:25.43,main,Drone,0,0,0,,Culverin Bear and Steel-chan are dating!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:28.17,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Oh hang on, is that for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.17,0:21:30.39,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,I totally had a feeling, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.65,0:21:35.12,main,Drone,0,0,0,,I hear they were together at the \Nhigh school culture festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:37.18,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Young love goals!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.18,0:21:40.40,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,A culture festival date \Nis total young love goals!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:40.73,top,Drone,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.73,0:21:42.83,main,Drone,0,0,0,,But inter-company romance \Nis against the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.83,0:21:46.91,main,Drone,0,0,0,,So actually going through with it \Nseems a little inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.91,0:21:50.05,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,But that's what makes it frickin' sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.05,0:21:51.16,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Hey, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.43,0:21:55.01,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,If you were gonna date someone, \Nwho'd you go for? Matchlock Eagle?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.01,0:21:56.29,main,Drone,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.29,0:21:58.79,main,Drone,0,0,0,,He's far too self-aggrandizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.79,0:22:01.91,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Then what about Railgun Lion?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.91,0:22:02.98,main,Drone,0,0,0,,I don't think so...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.98,0:22:05.51,main,Drone,0,0,0,,I can't handle those "ora-ora" types.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.51,0:22:06.63,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Hard same!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.63,0:22:08.55,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Gatling Wolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.55,0:22:11.16,main,Drone,0,0,0,,He's too neurotic and fastidious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.16,0:22:12.76,main,Drone,0,0,0,,I don't think I could ever date him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.60,0:22:19.19,main,Drone,0,0,0,,A good man is hard to find, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.19,0:22:20.91,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Yeah, and it's so crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.91,0:22:24.58,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,I can't believe Steel's into Culverin Bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.58,0:22:27.17,main,Drone,0,0,0,,She is still young, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.17,0:22:30.17,main,Drone,0,0,0,,Maybe she's confused huggability \Nfor something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.17,0:22:33.69,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Doubt you'll see any other member of the \NPrincess Series doing the romance thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.69,0:22:35.29,main,Drone,0,0,0,,What about Reaper-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.29,0:22:45.10,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Reaper, huh? Yeah, nah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.10,0:22:46.01,main,Drone,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.01,0:22:46.59,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Oh, totes nah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.59,0:22:48.09,main,Drone,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.49,0:22:51.76,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:53.51,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Have you been a good girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.67,0:22:57.91,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,My mistress had another good day, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.49,0:23:00.76,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Ready for my hot bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.98,0:23:05.31,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,Because of that goon of a man, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.31,0:23:08.49,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,Not that I like to admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:16.94,italics,Hellko,0,0,0,,But if my mistress is happy, \NI suppose I'll allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.46,0:23:23.21,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,What is justice? What is peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.21,0:23:27.46,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Like hot-burning ice, they break \Nthrough the chaos of the age!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.46,0:23:30.70,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Their name, Freezing Sentai Gelato 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.47,0:23:32.74,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Tune in next week!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.74,0:23:35.68,italicstop,Narrator,0,0,0,,Next time, Episode 11: "What's the\N Point of Getting Closer?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.97,0:23:40.25,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(40,300)\fad(1005,1)\fsp1.3}Episode 11   {\fsp1.9}What's the Point of Getting Closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.68,0:23:37.43,top,Fudo,0,0,0,,Humanity, preach love!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.72,0:23:39.89,italicstop,Desumi,0,0,0,,Is that what this show is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.85,0:23:39.89,sign_23143_224_Clink___,,0,0,0,,{\move(525,150,525,128,1,715)\frz335.5\fad(40,1)}Clink...
